  "details": "If you have more than one physbone collider with \"Inside Bounds\" checked, only the first in the list is evaluated, an all others are ignored.\n\nExpected behavior:\n\nMultiple colliders produce a combined volume of valid area for the physbone to occupy.\n\nActual Behavior: \n\nOnly the first collider in the list is evaluated, an all others are ignored. All bones are forced to occupy only the space of the first collider.",
